cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material in research, teaching, or technical writing, please cite it as below."
title: "Agentic AI Engineer: An open learning hub for building real agentic AI systems"
abstract: >-
  An open, community-maintained reference and curriculum for engineers building
  agentic AI systems. Covers stable concepts (agents, RAG, multi-agent topologies,
  context engineering, evaluation) and dated snapshots of fast-changing tooling
  (LangGraph, MCP, A2A, LangSmith, vector databases). Organized as learning paths,
  concept pages, labs, recipes, architecture patterns, and projects, with an
  integrated mathematical-foundations track.

